msgstr "Ficha hii"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:512
msgid "Zinn® hosting for WordPress"
msgstr "Uhosti wa Zinn® kwa ajili ya WordPress"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:513
msgid "LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site."
msgstr "LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamishaji wa bila malipo na paneli dhibiti iliyoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha tovuti zaidi ya moja."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:519
msgid "The Zinn® marketplace"
msgstr "Soko la Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:520
msgid "Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy."
msgstr "Nunua na uuze tovuti zilizothibitishwa, vikoa na upangaji wa viungo, huku pesa zikiwekwa salama hadi pande zote mbili ziridhike."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:567
msgid "Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living"
msgstr "Zinn Hub® — ajiri watu wanaofanya kazi hii ili kujipatia riziki"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:568
msgid "Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid."
msgstr "Soko letu la kimataifa la wataalamu huru: vinjari zaidi ya huduma 10,000 zilizotayarishwa tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, wasanidi programu na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwape nafasi ya kutoa zabuni."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:118
msgid "Style preset"
msgstr "Weka mapema ya mtindo"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:119
msgid "A starting point. Anything below overrides it."
msgstr "Sehemu ya kuanzia. Chochote kilicho hapa chini kinachukua nafasi yake."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:126
msgid "Use my own colours and sizes"
msgstr "Tumia rangi na saizi zangu mwenyewe"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-style-presets.php:127
msgid "Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is."
msgstr "Acha hii ikiwa imezimwa na mpangilio wa awali utatumika jinsi ulivyo."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:253
msgid "See the Zinn Digital® release notes."
msgstr "Tazama madokezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:302
msgid "The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again."
msgstr "Huduma ya kusasisha ya Zinn® haikutoa kiungo cha kupakua kwa sasisho hili. Angalia ikiwa tovuti hii inaweza kufikia jukwaa la Zinn®, kisha ujaribu tena."

#. translators: %s: the download error reported by WordPress.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:316
#, php-format
msgid "The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "Sasisho halikuweza kupakuliwa kutoka kwa huduma ya sasisho ya Zinn® (%s). Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-updater.php:330
msgid "The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed."
msgstr "Sasisho lililopakuliwa limeshindwa kukaguliwa uadilifu wake na halijasakinishwa."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-ability.php:94
msgid "The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator."
msgstr "Kitendo hakikuweza kukamilika. Jaribu tena, na kikiendelea kushindwa, wasiliana na msimamizi wa tovuti."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:704
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:715
msgid "Connect an AI app"
msgstr "Unganisha programu ya AI"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:717
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:723
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:764
msgid "This connection request has expired. Go back to the app and start connecting again."
msgstr "Ombi hili la muunganisho limekwisha muda wake. Rudi kwenye programu na uanze kuunganisha tena."

#. translators: 1: the AI app's name, 2: the plugin's MCP server name, 3: the WordPress user's display name.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:731
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings."
msgstr "%1$s inaomba kutumia %2$s kwenye tovuti hii kama %3$s. Inaweza kufanya kile tu ambacho akaunti yako ya WordPress inaruhusiwa kufanya, na unaweza kuiondoa wakati wowote kutoka kwenye mipangilio ya mawakala wa AI (MCP)."

#. translators: 1: the AI app's name, 2: a domain name.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:734
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s identified itself from %2$s."
msgstr "%1$s imejitambulisha kutoka %2$s."

#. translators: 1: the AI app's name, 2: a domain name.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:737
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s."
msgstr "%1$s imejisajili yenyewe kiotomatiki. Endelea tu ikiwa ulianzisha hii kutoka %2$s."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:741
msgid "Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator."
msgstr "Akaunti yako haiwezi kutumia zana hizi kwenye tovuti hii. Uliza msimamizi."

#. translators: %s: a domain name.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:744
#, php-format
msgid "After you answer you will go back to %s."
msgstr "Baada ya kujibu utarudi kwenye %s."

#. translators: %s: the AI app's name.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:749
#, php-format
msgid "Allow %s"
msgstr "Ruhusu %s"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-oauth.php:750
msgid "Do not allow"
msgstr "Usiruhusu"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-rest-bridge.php:325
msgid "A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability's input schema."
msgstr "Thamani inayohitajika haipo au ina muundo usio sahihi. Angalia muundo wa ingizo (input schema) wa uwezo huo."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-rest-bridge.php:358
msgid "The site refused the request."
msgstr "Tovuti imekataa ombi hilo."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:118
msgid "Unknown tool."
msgstr "Zana isiyojulikana."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:315
msgid "Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do."
msgstr "Ruhusu wasaidizi wa AI kama vile Claude, Cursor au VS Code wakufanyie kazi kwenye tovuti hii kupitia MCP (Model Context Protocol). Wanaingia kama mtumiaji wa WordPress (Claude na ChatGPT kwa kuwaidhinisha hapa, wengine kwa nenosiri la programu) na wanaweza kufanya kile tu ambacho mtumiaji huyo anaruhusiwa kufanya."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:317
msgid "AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them."
msgstr "Wakala wa AI wanahitaji WordPress 6.9 au toleo jipya zaidi. Sasisha WordPress ili kuwatumia."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:330
msgid "Connection address (MCP endpoint)"
msgstr "Anwani ya muunganisho (kikomo cha MCP)"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:334
msgid "Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead"
msgstr "Claude na ChatGPT: ingia badala yake"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:335
msgid "Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy."
msgstr "Ongeza anwani ya muunganisho kama kiunganishi maalum katika Claude, au kama programu katika hali ya msanidi wa ChatGPT. Zinafungua tovuti hii ili uweze kuziidhinisha; hakuna nenosiri la kunakili."

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:337
msgid "AI apps connected to your account:"
msgstr "Programu za AI zilizounganishwa kwenye akaunti yako:"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:346
msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "Tenganisha"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:352
msgid "Other AI apps: an application password"
msgstr "Programu nyingine za AI: nenosiri la programu"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:354
msgid "Create an application password for your user"
msgstr "Unda nenosiri la programu kwa ajili ya mtumiaji wako"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:355
msgid "Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:"
msgstr "Ongeza hii kwenye mipangilio ya MCP ya programu yako ya AI, pamoja na jina lako la mtumiaji na nenosiri hilo:"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:357
msgid "VS Code: put the same entry under \"servers\" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under \"mcpServers\"."
msgstr "VS Code: weka ingizo sawa chini ya \"servers\" katika .vscode/mcp.json, si chini ya \"mcpServers\"."

#. translators: %d: how many tools an AI agent can use.
#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:361
#, php-format
msgid "Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):"
msgstr "Zana ambazo wakala wa AI anaweza kutumia hapa (%d):"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:372
msgid "User guide: AI agents and MCP"
msgstr "Mwongozo wa mtumiaji: Mawakala wa AI na MCP"

#: includes/mcp-kit/class-server.php:375
msgid "Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP"
msgstr "Nyaraka za wasanidi programu: uwezo, REST na MCP"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:54
msgid "Manage your hosting clients, their plans and their sites on Zinn Digital® from this site."
msgstr "Dhibiti wateja wako wa upangishaji, mipango yao na tovuti zao kwenye Zinn Digital® kutoka kwa tovuti hii."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:60
msgid "Your clients, their plans and their sites, through your Zinn Digital® reseller account."
msgstr "Wateja wako, mipango yao na tovuti zao, kupitia akaunti yako ya muuzaji ya Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:108
msgid "Read your reseller account"
msgstr "Soma akaunti yako ya muuzaji"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:109
msgid "Returns your reseller account in one read: brand, plans, clients and services counts, and what is set up."
msgstr "Hurejesha akaunti yako ya muuzaji tena kwa usomaji mmoja: chapa, mipango, idadi ya wateja na huduma, na kile kilichowekwa."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:115
msgid "List your clients"
msgstr "Orodhesha wateja wako"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:116
msgid "Lists your client accounts, a page at a time (cursor, limit)."
msgstr "Huorodhesha akaunti za wateja wako, ukurasa mmoja kwa wakati mmoja (cursor, limit)."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:122
msgid "Create a client"
msgstr "Unda mteja"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:123
msgid "Creates a client account under yours (name; default_currency, a three-letter code). Put them on a plan before their first site."
msgstr "Inaunda akaunti ya mteja chini ya yako (name; default_currency, msimbo wa herufi tatu). Waweke kwenye mpango kabla ya tovuti yao ya kwanza."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:142
msgid "Read a client's plan"
msgstr "Soma mpango wa mteja"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:143
msgid "Returns which plan a client is on and what it costs you (client_id)."
msgstr "Hurejesha mpango ambao mteja anatumia na gharama yake kwako (client_id)."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:149
msgid "Put a client on a plan"
msgstr "Weka mteja kwenye mpango"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:150
msgid "Puts a client on one of your plans (client_id, plan_code; interval: month or year). Do this before their first site."
msgstr "Huweka mteja kwenye moja ya mipango yako (client_id, plan_code; interval: month au year). Fanya hivi kabla ya tovuti yao ya kwanza."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:172
msgid "List the plans you can sell"
msgstr "Orodhesha mipango unayoweza kuuza"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:173
msgid "Lists the hosting plans and their prices (product_line and currency narrow it)."
msgstr "Huorodhesha mipango ya upangishaji na bei zake (product_line na currency huipunguza)."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:187
msgid "List your clients' sites"
msgstr "Orodhesha tovuti za wateja wako"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:188
msgid "Lists everything you have provisioned for your clients (client_id and status narrow it), a page at a time."
msgstr "Huorodhesha kila kitu ulichotoa kwa ajili ya wateja wako (client_id na status huipunguza), ukurasa mmoja kwa wakati mmoja."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:199
msgid "Create a site for a client"
msgstr "Tengeneza tovuti kwa ajili ya mteja"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:200
msgid "Creates a hosted site for one of your clients (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). It is billed to your account at the client's plan, as from your shop."
msgstr "Hutengeneza tovuti inayopangishwa kwa ajili ya mmoja wa wateja wako (client_id, product_line, primary_domain). Inatozwa kwenye akaunti yako kulingana na mpango wa mteja, kama kutoka kwenye duka lako."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:220
msgid "Suspend a client's site"
msgstr "Simamisha tovuti ya mteja"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:221
msgid "Puts a client's site on a non-payment hold (site_id; reason: your own note, never shown to the client). The site stops serving until it is unsuspended."
msgstr "Huweka tovuti ya mteja kwenye usitishaji kwa sababu ya kutolipa (site_id; reason: dokezo lako mwenyewe, halionyeshwi mteja kamwe). Tovuti huacha kutoa huduma hadi kusimamishwa kwake kuondolewe."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:239
msgid "Unsuspend a client's site"
msgstr "Rejesha tovuti ya mteja iliyosimamishwa"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:240
msgid "Lifts a non-payment hold, so the site serves again (site_id)."
msgstr "Huondoa kizuizi cha kutolipa, ili tovuti ianze kufanya kazi tena (site_id)."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:249
msgid "Read the Reseller Toolkit settings"
msgstr "Soma mipangilio ya Zana za Muuzaji Mkuu"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:250
msgid "Returns this plugin's settings (the API address, the plan new orders use, which features are on). The API key is never returned, only whether one is saved."
msgstr "Hurejesha mipangilio ya programu-jalizi hii (anwani ya API, mpango unaotumiwa na maagizo mapya, vipengele vilivyowashwa). Ufunguo wa API haurejeshwi kamwe, bali iwapo kuna uliowekwa akiba pekee."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:256
msgid "Change the Reseller Toolkit settings"
msgstr "Badilisha mipangilio ya Reseller Toolkit"

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:257
msgid "Changes the settings you send (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) and keeps the rest. The API key and address are changed on the screen only."
msgstr "Hubadilisha mipangilio unayotuma (plan_code, enable_domain_search, enable_panel_link, enable_woocommerce) na kuhifadhi iliyobaki. Ufunguo wa API na anwani hubadilishwa kwenye skrini pekee."

#: includes/mcp/class-abilities.php:306
msgid "Add your Zinn Digital® reseller API key on the Reseller Toolkit screen first."
msgstr "Kwanza ongeza ufunguo wako wa API ya muuzaji wa Zinn Digital® kwenye skrini ya Reseller Toolkit."
